{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2020-06-07 08:30:00', 'title': 'EMIRATES NBD, VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT', 'text': 'EMIRATES NBD AND VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT.EMIRATES NBD AND VISA COMMIT TO ANOTHER TERM IN THEIR PARTNERSHIP TO FURTHER DIGITAL PAYMENTS AND DELIVER INNOVATION AND CUSTOMER-CENTRIC SOLUTIONS TO CARDHOLDERS.AS PART OF FIVE-YEAR PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT, VISA HAS SECURED EXCLUSIVITY OVER EMIRATES NBD’S DEBIT CARD OFFERING TO PERSONAL, PRIORITY, PRIVATE AND BUSINESS BANKING CUSTOMERS, AND DEBIT CARD PROGRAMME FOR LIV. EMIRATES NBD’S LIFESTYLE DIGITAL-ONLY BANK.TWO COMPANIES HAVE RENEWED THEIR AGREEMENT ON EXISTING CREDIT OFFERINGS WHICH INCLUDE PREMIUM PRODUCTS SUCH AS VISA INFINITE PRIVILEGE, VISA INFINITE AND VISA SIGNATURE.'}{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2020-06-07 08:30:00', 'title': 'EMIRATES NBD, VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT', 'text': 'EMIRATES NBD AND VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT.EMIRATES NBD AND VISA COMMIT TO ANOTHER TERM IN THEIR PARTNERSHIP TO FURTHER DIGITAL PAYMENTS AND DELIVER INNOVATION AND CUSTOMER-CENTRIC SOLUTIONS TO CARDHOLDERS.AS PART OF FIVE-YEAR PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT, VISA HAS SECURED EXCLUSIVITY OVER EMIRATES NBD’S DEBIT CARD OFFERING TO PERSONAL, PRIORITY, PRIVATE AND BUSINESS BANKING CUSTOMERS, AND DEBIT CARD PROGRAMME FOR LIV. EMIRATES NBD’S LIFESTYLE DIGITAL-ONLY BANK.TWO COMPANIES HAVE RENEWED THEIR AGREEMENT ON EXISTING CREDIT OFFERINGS WHICH INCLUDE PREMIUM PRODUCTS SUCH AS VISA INFINITE PRIVILEGE, VISA INFINITE AND VISA SIGNATURE.'}{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2020-06-07 08:30:00', 'title': 'EMIRATES NBD, VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT', 'text': 'EMIRATES NBD AND VISA RENEW PARTNERSHIP WITH A FIVE-YEAR AGREEMENT.EMIRATES NBD AND VISA COMMIT TO ANOTHER TERM IN THEIR PARTNERSHIP TO FURTHER DIGITAL PAYMENTS AND DELIVER INNOVATION AND CUSTOMER-CENTRIC SOLUTIONS TO CARDHOLDERS.AS PART OF FIVE-YEAR PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT, VISA HAS SECURED EXCLU